  "_comment": [
    "EXAMPLE seed for scripts/mll_seed.py - nothing here is a verified token link.",
    "Wikipedia titles are from memory: open each article (or call the Wikipedia API) and fix the title before seeding; a wrong title is reported honestly as UNAVAILABLE no_article, never as zero.",
    "Every TO_VERIFY value is a placeholder. A TO_VERIFY alias is skipped; a link whose mint is TO_VERIFY is reported as pending.",
    "Never type a mint from memory. Find candidates on DexScreener, verify against the meme's own website/social accounts, then replace the slot with a real mint + confidence + evidence_url (+ evidence_note for manual, or matched for website_match/social_link_match).",
    "A ticker or name match is never evidence. linked_at is never accepted: the server stamps it.",
    "A 'domain' alias is the meme's canonical site (e.g. example.org); a 'social_handle' alias is its canonical account handle."
